      "description": "A deep rift emerges between nations pursuing strict sovereign control over AI systems and those embracing distributed, adaptive governance models. The schism crystallizes around conflicting responses to recursive self-improvement, with some states criminalizing autonomous training loops while others tacitly allow them, creating a patchwork of compliance and leakage that undermines global coordination.",
