      "description": "The wave of AI-driven job losses accelerates across legal, radiology, and software sectors, with multiple member states reporting record declines in mid-level professional hiring. Regional protests erupt over delayed retraining programs, and national labour ministries warn of systemic strain. The issue dominates public discourse, increasing pressure on EU institutions to deliver structural labour reforms.",
